[h1]Phobos Framework 0.30.3[/h1]
[b]Draft - not published | 2026-09-27[/b]

[h2]Changed[/h2]

[list]
[*]Add a shared stock-coverage helper that fills omitted item offers without duplicating an already prepared lot or replacing its condition. Existing merchant inventories, native pricing and other providers remain untouched.
[*]Applies to future native stock and loot generation; no forced restocks, saved-cargo changes, price changes or live gameplay validation. See [url=https://github.com/phobos-dthorga/phobos-ostranauts/blob/main/docs/merchant-stock.md]merchant availability and salvage[/url].
[/list]
